## Task workflow (Maestro)

For every task that changes something (feature, fix, refactor, config, data work), use the
`maestro` skill automatically. Do not wait to be asked, and do not ask me to explain the process.
- Analyze first. If there are business or domain decisions, present them as an expert, with options and a recommendation, and wait for my approval.
- Plan with speckit when it is available. Write explicit task cards.
- Delegate the implementation to free models through `maestro-router` (configured in ~/.config/maestro or .maestro/).
- Save Claude tokens: Claude leads, decides, plans, and accepts. Free models implement and do the first review.
- Talk to me in Arabic. Write task cards in English.
